    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O'Gara is delighted to bring to market No. 14 Rossaun House, a one-bedroom apartment on the third floor of the sought-after Seven Oaks development in Rathmines. This light-filled apartment spans approximately 40 sq.m. and features an entrance hall with storage, a fitted kitchen, a bright living/dining area, one generously sized double bedroom, and a bathroom.\r\n\r\nTucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac, Seven Oaks is one of Rathmines' most desirable developments, offering exceptional convenience. Just a short stroll from both Ranelagh Village and Rathmines, the area boasts a wealth of restaurants, shops, and local services. Top schools, including Scoil Bhríde, Ranelagh Multi-Denominational School, Gonzaga College, Sandford Park, Muckross Park College, Alexandra College, and St. Mary’s College, are all within walking distance. The Beechwood LUAS stop, which provides quick access to the City Centre, is also just a short walk away.\r\n\r\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity to secure a home in one of Dublin’s most coveted locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Third floor 1 bed apartment \r\nResidents parking \r\nPrivate gated development 40 m sq. \r\nDouble glazed throughout \r\nPrime location \r\nManagement fee C. €2,675 pa \r\nBER - E2\r\nParking: Residents parking 1 designated car park"
      },
